SUMMARY:Jingle Bell Run and Holiday Stroll
LOCATION:Grace Episcopal Church\, 305 Arnold Street NE\, Cullman
DESCRIPTION:Grace Episcopal Church hosts its first Christmas Carol Classic\
 , a 5K Jingle Bell Run and 1 mile Holiday Stroll through downtown Cullman 
 past the Christkindlmarkt. Holiday outfits and leashed pets are welcome\, 
 and proceeds help local nonprofits. Time: 8:00 AM to 10:30 AM Host: Grace 
 Episcopal Church
